- `openWith_originEnd` / host-sim `plant-base-past-origin` (HOST-65) keep the count-0 run start at open.

**Premise spread (priced before building, ROOT GO).** Measured first: `StoreIndexes`, `Coherent`, `RunFrom` have no consumer outside Host/Proofs/StoreIndex.lean (no module imports it; Coherence.lean and Open.lean name it in prose).
