- Restated only (conclusions strengthen): `StoreIndexes.of_open_empty` (at `o.sealed.steps`), `genesis_indexes` (at `w₀.steps`), `import_indexes` (at `w₀.steps`), `StoreIndexes.append`, `StoreIndexes.cut_open`, `openWith_indexes` (RunFrom in pair form, plus `openWith_run` split out), `page_beforeLog_origin` (+ `e₀.steps = s₀ ∧ start < s₀`, over `checkpointed` too). `indexClean` takes `steps`; `indexClean_none`, `indexClean_unread`, `indexClean_count` restated over it; host-sim's five `indexClean` calls pass the genesis step count.
- `Entry.read_extract_append` is generalized from an entry of `L` to any position below the count.

