- every default target built: the non-Hosting targets at the 6G/2-thread cap (514 jobs, logs/host22-bA.log), host-file-sim / host-sock-probe / live-calls (216 jobs), Hosting and its exes at 16G for Hosting.Proofs.Reply (320 jobs, logs/host22-bH.log; the bench window checked closed first);
