## HOST-70 · HOST-50's five WEAK triggers re-checked against eb7028d: one FIRED (the Tail across a segment rotation) and found an unnamed throw — a reader standing in a file a finite retention unlinked is now refused `missing seg.<o>.log` by name (2026-10-20, HOST-22; HOST-19's queue, the HOST-50 WEAKs vs HOST-64)

